"What the SRI called this concept **in this era**, as the source cell spells "
"it, stripped of leading and trailing whitespace only. It is era-scoped "
"because the SRI reuses a code for a different concept: 341 is *Otras "
"retenciones aplicables el 2%* in 2014 and *Impuesto único a la exportación "
"de banano* in 2019."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_ec_ats
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ec_ats.field_l10n_ec_ats_catalog_table__source_reference
msgid ""
